{"4967810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Food Inspector Simulator", "steam_appid": 4967810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a sanitary inspector in 1990s Poland. Inspect restaurants, bars, and shops in a world where business grows faster than the rulebook - and every owner is convinced it’ll somehow work out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dining area may look spotless, but the truth is usually waiting out back. Check fridges, storerooms, kitchens, and staff toilets. Question the owners and look for everything they hoped you’d never find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos, measure temperatures, use a UV lamp, and record every violation. Rotten meat, fake labels, and suspicious canned goods - every establishment has secrets of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the inspection, decide what makes it into the report. Issue a fine, shut the place down, or accept a discreet envelope under the table and look the other way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new complaints, new violations, and new decisions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a sanitary inspector in 1990s Poland. Inspect restaurants, bars, and shops in a world where business grows faster than the rulebook - and every owner is convinced it’ll somehow work out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fff9313ada691917dd2889522e101e8e.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dining area may look spotless, but the truth is usually waiting out back. Check fridges, storerooms, kitchens, and staff toilets. Question the owners and look for everything they hoped you’d never find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/384bb13e2a348b416f24d7daaf7a6abd.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos, measure temperatures, use a UV lamp, and record every violation. Rotten meat, fake labels, and suspicious canned goods - every establishment has secrets of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/fa3ee50142fab58d8410b6d9812ed14d.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the inspection, decide what makes it into the report. Issue a fine, shut the place down, or accept a discreet envelope under the table and look the other way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.poster.avif?t=1785503060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.webm?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/extras/098030a48a704ed652e08d7a21c05eee.mp4?t=1785503060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new complaints, new violations, and new decisions.</p>", "short_description": "Inspect bars, shops, and restaurants across 90s Poland! Search the kitchens for rats, expired food, and other violations. In the end, make your call: a fine, a shutdown, or accept an envelope slipped under the table?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4967810/d778396bb54ed04ce6d99fefe57c38e8a2